# Recipe: content with no source file of its own.  The name "font/cascadiamono/16" is this
# file's path under content/ minus the extension; "kind" is what it cooks to, which decides
# the cooked file name (font -> font/cascadiamono/16.orb_font).  The face is the one in
# family.txt beside this file unless a "face" line here overrides it; "size" is the pixel
# size; optional "sdf <spread>" bakes a distance field and optional "range <spec>" bakes
# past ASCII (see font_tool -range).

kind    font
size    16
